{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0263F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"云雾林分布在中部山区。那里常年雾气笼罩，光是站在那里，身体都会被打湿。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_OMISSION_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"整片森林都像在云里一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"看来视野会很差。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"嗯。不过那片森林非常漂亮。神秘得像误入了一座绿色迷宫。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……还是小心点，别真的迷路了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"JPN_CAUTION_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那里还栖息着许多珍稀动物，尤其有很多漂亮的青蛙。也许是因为湿气重吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"AUX_FROG_AND_HUMIDITY_DETAIL_RESTORED"}]}